  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算統計與數據分析導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTATIONAL STATISTICS AND DATA ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程教授計算方法在統計學基礎及其應用，學生將學用統計軟體進行數據分析，並應用基礎統計方法解決問題。涵蓋資料整理、數據呈現、統計分析並應用於解決實際問題等，適合數據科學與統計分析學生。",
    "describe_eh": "This course teaches the foundations of statistics and their computational methods, where students will learn to perform data analysis using statistical software and apply basic statistical methods to solve problems. It covers data organization, data presentation, statistical analysis, and application to real-world issues, suitable for students in data science and statistical analysis.",
